    "created_at": "2026-03-24T07:00:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-24T07:00:50Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is a documentation issue. I think the requirements got confused along the way, or the requirements were incorrectly spec'd.\n\nIf our view is that developers shouldn't be able to do a thing, we should enforce that, or we should allow it but make it work in some meaningful way. ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
