    "created_at": "2026-03-26T13:10:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-26T13:10:58Z",
    "body": "> That's a fairly large \"what if\", since it requires re-thinking the entire two stack model.\n\nThe thing is there's not actually two stacks in the spec, there's the top layer set and functions that filter that down. I think we could just change the logic around which items from the top layer we care about (or make an actual seperate stacks).",
